    },
    {
      "id": "6a96cf030000000000474040",
      "text": "[UserScript.icon] [PopupMenu系.icon] [UserScript: スニペット候補系.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788268291,
      "updated": 1788268308
    },
    {
      "id": "63c685695b98c20000ee58cc",
      "text": "[サイコロトーク]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1673954665,
      "updated": 1673954702
    },
    {
      "id": "63c6858e5b98c20000ee58cd",
      "text": " code:script.js",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1673954702,
      "updated": 1673954702
    },
    {
      "id": "63c6858e5b98c20000ee58ce",
      "text": "   const choice = (arr) => arr[Math.floor(Math.random()*arr.length)]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1673954702,
      "updated": 1673954702
    },
    {
      "id": "63c6858e5b98c20000ee58cf",
      "text": "    scrapbox.PopupMenu.addButton({",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1673954702,
      "updated": 1673954702
    },
    {
      "id": "63c6858e5b98c20000ee58d0",
      "text": "      title: '🎲',",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1673954702,
      "updated": 1673954702
    },
    {
      "id": "63c6858e5b98c20000ee58d1",
      "text": "      onClick: text => choice([",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1673954702,
      "updated": 1673954702
    },
    {
      "id": "63c6858e5b98c20000ee58d2",
      "text": "     　　' #情けない話 ',",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1673954702,
      "updated": 1673954702
    },
    {
      "id": "63c6858e5b98c20000ee58d3",
      "text": "     　　' #ここだけの話 ',",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1673954702,
      "updated": 1673954702
    },
    {
      "id": "63c6858e5b98c20000ee58d4",
      "text": "     　　' #初めて○○した話 ',",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1673954702,
      "updated": 1673954702
    },
    {
      "id": "63c6858e5b98c20000ee58d5",
      "text": "     　　' #ひょっとしたら私だけ ',",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1673954702,
      "updated": 1673954702
    },
    {
      "id": "63c6858e5b98c20000ee58d6",
      "text": "     　　' #恥ずかしい話 ',",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1673954702,
      "updated": 1673954702
    },
    {
      "id": "63c6858e5b98c20000ee58d7",
      "text": "     　　' #怖い話 ',",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1673954702,
      "updated": 1673954702
    },
    {
      "id": "63c6858e5b98c20000ee58d8",
      "text": "     　　' #今だからゴメンナサイ話 ',",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1673954702,
      "updated": 1673954702
    },
    {
      "id": "63c6858e5b98c20000ee58d9",
      "text": "     　　' #今日の当たり目 '])+text,",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1673954702,
      "updated": 1673954702
    },
    {
      "id": "63c6858e5b98c20000ee58da",
      "text": "    });",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1673954702,
      "updated": 1673954702
    },
    {
      "id": "63c6858e5b98c20000ee58db",
      "text": "   ",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1673954702,
      "updated": 1673954702
    },
    {
      "id": "63c6858e5b98c20000ee58dc",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1673954702,
      "updated": 1673954702
    },
    {
      "id": "63c685a25b98c20000ee58dd",
      "text": " ポップアップメニューの「🎲」をクリックすると、ランダムにトークのお題を出力する",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1673954723,
      "updated": 1673954935
    },
    {
      "id": "63c685c15b98c20000ee58de",
      "text": " サイコロとは言っているものの、実は、お題はいくつでも登録できる",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1673954754,
      "updated": 1673954972
    },
    {
      "id": "63c686595b98c20000ee58e1",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1673954906,
      "updated": 1673954906
    },
